*.egg-info/
# NOTE: the bare `lib/` above is the Python build-output ignore. It is
# unanchored, so it also matches Flutter source dirs named `lib/` —
# specifically the app at kb_flutter/lib/ AND the vendored (patched) AppFlowy
# package at kb_flutter/third_party/appflowy_editor/lib/. The two negations
# above re-include both; without them a fresh clone can't build (pubspec.yaml
# has a `path:` dep on that vendored package). Keep them together.
.installed.cfg
*.egg
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

